{"id":"vol8-07","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-07/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":414.01,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":4.84,"text":"Part 3 You will hear two art students called Charlie","words":[["Part",0.0,0.24],["3",0.24,0.74],["You",0.74,2.22],["will",2.22,2.4],["hear",2.4,2.7],["two",2.7,3.06],["art",3.06,3.4],["students",3.4,3.84],["called",3.84,4.38],["Charlie",4.38,4.84]]},{"start":4.84,"end":11.48,"text":"and Sandra discussing their portfolios, which are collections of their best work to be handed","words":[["and",4.84,5.22],["Sandra",5.22,5.7],["discussing",5.7,6.7],["their",6.7,7.08],["portfolios,",7.08,8.04],["which",8.46,8.84],["are",8.84,8.98],["collections",8.98,9.44],["of",9.44,9.8],["their",9.8,9.96],["best",9.96,10.28],["work",10.28,10.68],["to",10.68,10.96],["be",10.96,11.08],["handed",11.08,11.48]]},{"start":11.48,"end":16.5,"text":"in for assessment. First you have some time to look at questions","words":[["in",11.48,11.78],["for",11.78,12.02],["assessment.",12.02,12.52],["First",13.86,14.58],["you",14.58,14.82],["have",14.82,15.0],["some",15.0,15.18],["time",15.18,15.58],["to",15.58,15.86],["look",15.86,15.98],["at",15.98,16.14],["questions",16.14,16.5]]},{"start":16.5,"end":68.13,"text":"21 to 26. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["21",16.5,17.38],["to",17.38,17.68],["26.",17.68,18.22],["Now",63.97,64.31],["listen",64.31,64.67],["carefully",64.67,65.13],["and",65.13,65.51],["answer",65.51,65.95],["questions",65.95,66.35],["21",66.35,67.25],["to",67.25,67.53],["26.",67.53,68.13]]},{"start":71.7,"end":77.12,"text":"Hi Sandra, have you got time to talk through a few things about preparing our art portfolios?","words":[["Hi",71.7,72.08],["Sandra,",72.08,72.44],["have",73.0,73.26],["you",73.26,73.44],["got",73.44,73.62],["time",73.62,73.86],["to",73.86,74.0],["talk",74.0,74.2],["through",74.2,74.4],["a",74.4,74.58],["few",74.58,74.7],["things",74.7,75.04],["about",75.04,75.3],["preparing",75.3,75.76],["our",75.76,76.08],["art",76.08,76.36],["portfolios?",76.36,77.12]]},{"start":77.12,"end":82.22,"text":"I've got some ideas for what to include in mine, but I'd like to hear about yours.","words":[["I've",77.12,78.1],["got",78.1,78.24],["some",78.24,78.46],["ideas",78.46,78.88],["for",78.88,79.24],["what",79.24,79.4],["to",79.4,79.56],["include",79.56,79.86],["in",79.86,80.1],["mine,",80.1,80.38],["but",80.42,80.64],["I'd",80.64,81.4],["like",81.4,81.52],["to",81.52,81.64],["hear",81.64,81.76],["about",81.76,81.94],["yours.",81.94,82.22]]},{"start":83.0,"end":88.72,"text":"I'm going to include an interpretation of a famous picture, and then pieces from each","words":[["I'm",83.0,83.28],["going",83.28,83.44],["to",83.44,83.66],["include",83.66,84.04],["an",84.04,84.34],["interpretation",84.34,84.84],["of",84.84,85.46],["a",85.46,85.58],["famous",85.58,85.84],["picture,",85.84,86.24],["and",86.82,87.3],["then",87.3,87.68],["pieces",87.68,88.04],["from",88.04,88.38],["each",88.38,88.72]]},{"start":88.72,"end":93.38,"text":"of my years of studying fine arts, because I think it's crucial to show progression,","words":[["of",88.72,88.86],["my",88.86,89.04],["years",89.04,89.32],["of",89.32,89.5],["studying",89.5,89.94],["fine",89.94,90.32],["arts,",90.32,90.78],["because",91.1,91.36],["I",91.36,91.58],["think",91.58,91.72],["it's",91.72,92.02],["crucial",92.02,92.4],["to",92.4,92.66],["show",92.66,92.88],["progression,",92.88,93.38]]},{"start":93.88,"end":97.26,"text":"even if some of them aren't representative of my best work now.","words":[["even",93.88,94.18],["if",94.18,94.38],["some",94.38,94.58],["of",94.58,94.7],["them",94.7,94.9],["aren't",94.9,95.24],["representative",95.24,95.8],["of",95.8,96.18],["my",96.18,96.38],["best",96.38,96.62],["work",96.62,96.92],["now.",96.92,97.26]]},{"start":97.58,"end":103.14,"text":"Oh, I was going to pick out the works that I think show creative thinking, but maybe","words":[["Oh,",97.58,97.92],["I",98.38,98.84],["was",98.84,98.96],["going",98.96,99.1],["to",99.1,99.22],["pick",99.22,99.38],["out",99.38,99.56],["the",99.56,99.7],["works",99.7,99.98],["that",99.98,100.2],["I",100.2,100.34],["think",100.34,100.58],["show",100.58,100.9],["creative",100.9,101.4],["thinking,",101.4,101.88],["but",102.2,102.42],["maybe",102.42,103.14]]},{"start":103.14,"end":103.58,"text":"you're right.","words":[["you're",103.14,103.34],["right.",103.34,103.58]]},{"start":103.58,"end":107.32,"text":"What are you going to include to show your understanding of design?","words":[["What",103.58,104.42],["are",104.42,104.58],["you",104.58,104.66],["going",104.66,104.86],["to",104.86,105.06],["include",105.06,105.38],["to",105.38,105.62],["show",105.62,105.8],["your",105.8,105.98],["understanding",105.98,106.52],["of",106.52,106.88],["design?",106.88,107.32]]},{"start":107.96,"end":110.48,"text":"I think I'm going to include that flyer I did.","words":[["I",107.96,108.26],["think",108.26,108.44],["I'm",108.44,108.64],["going",108.64,108.78],["to",108.78,109.0],["include",109.0,109.3],["that",109.3,109.54],["flyer",109.54,110.12],["I",110.12,110.26],["did.",110.26,110.48]]},{"start":111.1,"end":115.08,"text":"That publicity flyer for the music festival? Yes, that was great.","words":[["That",111.1,111.26],["publicity",111.26,111.68],["flyer",111.68,112.24],["for",112.24,112.3],["the",112.3,112.4],["music",112.4,112.68],["festival?",112.68,113.12],["Yes,",113.62,114.16],["that",114.3,114.46],["was",114.46,114.58],["great.",114.58,115.08]]},{"start":115.92,"end":120.36,"text":"I'm hoping to use my health and safety poster, the design elements strong.","words":[["I'm",115.92,116.18],["hoping",116.18,116.48],["to",116.48,116.72],["use",116.72,116.96],["my",116.96,117.22],["health",117.22,117.56],["and",117.56,117.74],["safety",117.74,118.04],["poster,",118.04,118.5],["the",119.04,119.18],["design",119.18,119.5],["elements",119.5,119.9],["strong.",119.9,120.36]]},{"start":121.1,"end":126.46,"text":"Some people are including photos of modern buildings, but I'm not so sure about photos.","words":[["Some",121.1,121.46],["people",121.46,121.8],["are",121.8,122.18],["including",122.18,122.56],["photos",122.56,123.02],["of",123.02,123.34],["modern",123.34,123.68],["buildings,",123.68,124.14],["but",124.36,124.52],["I'm",124.52,125.24],["not",125.24,125.36],["so",125.36,125.52],["sure",125.52,125.82],["about",125.82,126.0],["photos.",126.0,126.46]]},{"start":127.12,"end":130.72,"text":"Anyway, we've also got to show we've explored one medium in depth.","words":[["Anyway,",127.12,127.44],["we've",127.56,127.78],["also",127.78,128.18],["got",128.18,128.38],["to",128.38,128.56],["show",128.56,128.76],["we've",128.76,129.0],["explored",129.0,129.42],["one",129.42,129.7],["medium",129.7,130.12],["in",130.12,130.44],["depth.",130.44,130.72]]},{"start":130.72,"end":133.4,"text":"Well, what about choosing drawing?","words":[["Well,",130.72,131.4],["what",132.14,132.48],["about",132.48,132.68],["choosing",132.68,132.98],["drawing?",132.98,133.4]]},{"start":134.1,"end":137.08,"text":"That series we both did of the human body would be good, you know?","words":[["That",134.1,134.22],["series",134.22,134.58],["we",134.58,134.82],["both",134.82,135.06],["did",135.06,135.26],["of",135.26,135.42],["the",135.42,135.54],["human",135.54,135.78],["body",135.78,136.2],["would",136.2,136.38],["be",136.38,136.52],["good,",136.52,136.72],["you",136.8,136.92],["know?",136.92,137.08]]},{"start":137.36,"end":139.2,"text":"The set of pictures showing a man running?","words":[["The",137.36,137.56],["set",137.56,137.74],["of",137.74,137.88],["pictures",137.88,138.16],["showing",138.16,138.56],["a",138.56,138.74],["man",138.74,138.84],["running?",138.84,139.2]]},{"start":139.44,"end":143.38,"text":"Yes. They'd demonstrate that we can show a human body in action.","words":[["Yes.",139.44,139.68],["They'd",140.28,140.74],["demonstrate",140.74,141.2],["that",141.2,141.62],["we",141.62,141.78],["can",141.78,141.94],["show",141.94,142.14],["a",142.14,142.26],["human",142.26,142.52],["body",142.52,142.88],["in",142.88,143.1],["action.",143.1,143.38]]},{"start":143.9,"end":148.2,"text":"I think they'd be more impressive than those drawings we did of household objects.","words":[["I",143.9,144.28],["think",144.28,144.44],["they'd",144.44,144.66],["be",144.66,144.8],["more",144.8,145.06],["impressive",145.06,145.6],["than",145.6,145.94],["those",145.94,146.2],["drawings",146.2,146.56],["we",146.56,146.86],["did",146.86,147.0],["of",147.0,147.14],["household",147.14,147.56],["objects.",147.56,148.2]]},{"start":148.5,"end":152.9,"text":"Yes, I agree. The household objects would show we can draw details precisely","words":[["Yes,",148.5,148.78],["I",148.92,149.04],["agree.",149.04,149.38],["The",150.02,150.22],["household",150.22,150.54],["objects",150.54,151.04],["would",151.04,151.34],["show",151.34,151.64],["we",151.64,151.8],["can",151.8,152.0],["draw",152.0,152.22],["details",152.22,152.62],["precisely",152.62,152.9]]},{"start":153.42,"end":158.1,"text":"and position things on the paper effectively, but they were just static.","words":[["and",153.42,153.98],["position",153.98,154.36],["things",154.36,154.76],["on",154.76,155.0],["the",155.0,155.1],["paper",155.1,155.38],["effectively,",155.38,156.02],["but",156.64,156.92],["they",156.92,157.26],["were",157.26,157.4],["just",157.4,157.54],["static.",157.54,158.1]]},{"start":158.1,"end":163.1,"text":"Okay, now do you think I should include my work on deserts?","words":[["Okay,",158.1,159.12],["now",159.38,160.1],["do",160.1,160.42],["you",160.42,160.6],["think",160.6,160.76],["I",160.76,160.94],["should",160.94,161.06],["include",161.06,161.38],["my",161.38,161.64],["work",161.64,161.94],["on",161.94,162.14],["deserts?",162.14,163.1]]},{"start":163.2,"end":165.1,"text":"To be honest, I don't think so.","words":[["To",163.2,163.3],["be",163.3,163.46],["honest,",163.46,163.88],["I",164.22,164.46],["don't",164.46,164.6],["think",164.6,164.82],["so.",164.82,165.1]]},{"start":165.56,"end":167.7,"text":"You've got a huge amount of work on that subject,","words":[["You've",165.56,165.84],["got",165.84,165.96],["a",165.96,166.06],["huge",166.06,166.36],["amount",166.36,166.56],["of",166.56,166.76],["work",166.76,166.96],["on",166.96,167.18],["that",167.18,167.34],["subject,",167.34,167.7]]},{"start":167.92,"end":171.84,"text":"and I think the problem is that a lot of it will need extensive notes","words":[["and",167.92,168.3],["I",168.3,168.5],["think",168.5,168.7],["the",168.7,168.86],["problem",168.86,169.18],["is",169.18,169.52],["that",169.52,169.96],["a",169.96,170.12],["lot",170.12,170.28],["of",170.28,170.42],["it",170.42,170.54],["will",170.54,170.66],["need",170.66,170.8],["extensive",170.8,171.34],["notes",171.34,171.84]]},{"start":171.84,"end":174.78,"text":"so the tutor can understand the thinking behind the pieces.","words":[["so",171.84,172.3],["the",172.3,172.46],["tutor",172.46,172.62],["can",172.62,172.88],["understand",172.88,173.32],["the",173.32,173.52],["thinking",173.52,173.82],["behind",173.82,174.2],["the",174.2,174.42],["pieces.",174.42,174.78]]},{"start":175.4,"end":178.48,"text":"Pity, because you've dealt with it in a very unusual way.","words":[["Pity,",175.4,175.92],["because",176.28,176.46],["you've",176.46,176.72],["dealt",176.72,176.88],["with",176.88,177.06],["it",177.06,177.16],["in",177.16,177.28],["a",177.28,177.38],["very",177.38,177.64],["unusual",177.64,177.94],["way.",177.94,178.48]]},{"start":178.78,"end":179.4,"text":"You're right.","words":[["You're",178.78,179.12],["right.",179.12,179.4]]},{"start":180.0,"end":183.84,"text":"Right, now we need to think about the portfolio as a whole.","words":[["Right,",180.0,180.4],["now",180.76,181.16],["we",181.16,181.76],["need",181.76,181.96],["to",181.96,182.14],["think",182.14,182.32],["about",182.32,182.56],["the",182.56,182.72],["portfolio",182.72,183.2],["as",183.2,183.44],["a",183.44,183.56],["whole.",183.56,183.84]]},{"start":184.38,"end":185.58,"text":"How we organise it.","words":[["How",184.38,184.7],["we",184.7,184.86],["organise",184.86,185.2],["it.",185.2,185.58]]},{"start":185.58,"end":188.68,"text":"Did the tutor say anything about that? I can't remember.","words":[["Did",185.58,186.36],["the",186.36,186.56],["tutor",186.56,186.76],["say",186.76,187.06],["anything",187.06,187.22],["about",187.22,187.52],["that?",187.52,187.78],["I",188.1,188.22],["can't",188.22,188.42],["remember.",188.42,188.68]]},{"start":189.16,"end":194.86,"text":"I thought his most useful suggestion was to make sure similar pieces are put together so","words":[["I",189.16,189.4],["thought",189.4,189.72],["his",189.72,189.98],["most",189.98,190.28],["useful",190.28,190.78],["suggestion",190.78,191.34],["was",191.34,191.82],["to",191.82,192.04],["make",192.04,192.2],["sure",192.2,192.48],["similar",192.48,192.86],["pieces",192.86,193.28],["are",193.28,193.62],["put",193.62,193.76],["together",193.76,194.26],["so",194.26,194.86]]},{"start":194.86,"end":200.12,"text":"the portfolio has a clear structure. But he said we shouldn't worry about making a dramatic","words":[["the",194.86,195.02],["portfolio",195.02,195.4],["has",195.4,195.9],["a",195.9,196.06],["clear",196.06,196.32],["structure.",196.32,196.94],["But",197.3,197.86],["he",197.86,198.02],["said",198.02,198.2],["we",198.2,198.36],["shouldn't",198.36,198.64],["worry",198.64,198.9],["about",198.9,199.18],["making",199.18,199.5],["a",199.5,199.74],["dramatic",199.74,200.12]]},{"start":200.12,"end":206.56,"text":"impact at the beginning. Some students recommend saving the best piece till last, but I don't","words":[["impact",200.12,200.84],["at",200.84,201.04],["the",201.04,201.12],["beginning.",201.12,201.5],["Some",202.12,202.46],["students",202.46,202.92],["recommend",202.92,203.44],["saving",203.44,203.88],["the",203.88,204.12],["best",204.12,204.38],["piece",204.38,204.7],["till",204.7,204.94],["last,",204.94,205.42],["but",205.86,206.12],["I",206.12,206.3],["don't",206.3,206.56]]},{"start":206.56,"end":206.9,"text":"agree.","words":[["agree.",206.56,206.9]]},{"start":207.22,"end":212.26,"text":"No, nor do I. But everyone says it's a good idea to get someone else to look at","words":[["No,",207.22,207.6],["nor",207.76,207.86],["do",207.86,208.04],["I.",208.04,208.32],["But",208.86,209.08],["everyone",209.08,209.42],["says",209.42,209.82],["it's",209.82,210.12],["a",210.12,210.16],["good",210.16,210.36],["idea",210.36,210.74],["to",210.74,210.94],["get",210.94,211.12],["someone",211.12,211.42],["else",211.42,211.74],["to",211.74,211.98],["look",211.98,212.14],["at",212.14,212.26]]},{"start":212.26,"end":219.12,"text":"portfolio just before we submit it. Of course our art teacher will comment on it as we go along but","words":[["portfolio",212.26,212.74],["just",212.74,213.58],["before",213.58,213.88],["we",213.88,214.06],["submit",214.06,214.36],["it.",214.36,214.66],["Of",215.48,215.68],["course",215.68,215.98],["our",215.98,216.24],["art",216.24,216.66],["teacher",216.66,216.9],["will",216.9,217.12],["comment",217.12,217.46],["on",217.46,217.74],["it",217.74,217.92],["as",217.92,218.34],["we",218.34,218.46],["go",218.46,218.56],["along",218.56,218.9],["but",218.9,219.12]]},{"start":219.12,"end":225.46,"text":"who else are you going to ask? There's a sculptor who lives near me and my parents know him so that's","words":[["who",219.12,219.7],["else",219.7,219.88],["are",219.88,220.0],["you",220.0,220.06],["going",220.06,220.18],["to",220.18,220.34],["ask?",220.34,220.66],["There's",221.0,221.28],["a",221.28,221.4],["sculptor",221.4,221.96],["who",221.96,222.1],["lives",222.1,222.34],["near",222.34,222.58],["me",222.58,222.82],["and",222.82,223.46],["my",223.46,223.62],["parents",223.62,223.98],["know",223.98,224.34],["him",224.34,224.56],["so",224.56,224.86],["that's",224.86,225.46]]},{"start":225.46,"end":230.92,"text":"who I'm going for. I've got a friend who writes articles for the art section of a national newspaper","words":[["who",225.46,225.58],["I'm",225.58,225.78],["going",225.78,225.94],["for.",225.94,226.3],["I've",226.88,227.14],["got",227.14,227.24],["a",227.24,227.42],["friend",227.42,227.64],["who",227.64,227.9],["writes",227.9,228.12],["articles",228.12,228.68],["for",228.68,228.96],["the",228.96,229.06],["art",229.06,229.28],["section",229.28,229.72],["of",229.72,229.94],["a",229.94,230.04],["national",230.04,230.3],["newspaper",230.3,230.92]]},{"start":230.92,"end":240.86,"text":"and I was going to ask him but I decided he lives too far away. Before you hear the rest","words":[["and",230.92,231.72],["I",231.72,231.94],["was",231.94,232.18],["going",232.18,232.46],["to",232.46,232.66],["ask",232.66,232.92],["him",232.92,233.32],["but",233.32,233.94],["I",233.94,234.06],["decided",234.06,234.52],["he",234.52,234.76],["lives",234.76,234.96],["too",234.96,235.2],["far",235.2,235.48],["away.",235.48,235.78],["Before",239.26,239.76],["you",239.76,240.04],["hear",240.04,240.34],["the",240.34,240.58],["rest",240.58,240.86]]},{"start":240.86,"end":267.57,"text":"of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27 to 30. Now listen and answer","words":[["of",240.86,241.0],["the",241.0,241.08],["discussion,",241.08,241.48],["you",242.04,242.36],["have",242.36,242.58],["some",242.58,242.76],["time",242.76,243.22],["to",243.22,243.48],["look",243.48,243.64],["at",243.64,243.76],["questions",243.76,244.1],["27",244.1,245.0],["to",245.0,245.34],["30.",245.34,245.7],["Now",266.05,266.33],["listen",266.33,266.63],["and",266.63,267.11],["answer",267.11,267.57]]},{"start":267.57,"end":269.65,"text":"questions 27 to 30.","words":[["questions",267.57,267.95],["27",267.95,268.99],["to",268.99,269.27],["30.",269.27,269.65]]},{"start":273.08,"end":278.82,"text":"Okay, now our tutor said it's important to make sure the reason for including each piece","words":[["Okay,",273.08,273.68],["now",274.2,274.5],["our",274.5,274.88],["tutor",274.88,275.08],["said",275.08,275.4],["it's",275.4,275.62],["important",275.62,276.08],["to",276.08,276.36],["make",276.36,276.56],["sure",276.56,276.86],["the",276.86,277.0],["reason",277.0,277.4],["for",277.4,277.64],["including",277.64,278.08],["each",278.08,278.48],["piece",278.48,278.82]]},{"start":278.82,"end":283.98,"text":"in our portfolio is clear. I think I've more or less decided about that for my portfolio.","words":[["in",278.82,279.0],["our",279.0,279.16],["portfolio",279.16,279.54],["is",279.54,279.86],["clear.",279.86,280.18],["I",280.9,281.06],["think",281.06,281.34],["I've",281.34,281.64],["more",281.64,281.92],["or",281.92,282.1],["less",282.1,282.32],["decided",282.32,282.8],["about",282.8,283.02],["that",283.02,283.26],["for",283.26,283.44],["my",283.44,283.56],["portfolio.",283.56,283.98]]},{"start":284.72,"end":289.14,"text":"Have you? I haven't thought about it at all. What have you decided?","words":[["Have",284.72,285.2],["you?",285.2,285.44],["I",285.88,286.06],["haven't",286.06,286.3],["thought",286.3,286.44],["about",286.44,286.72],["it",286.72,286.94],["at",286.94,287.06],["all.",287.06,287.48],["What",288.16,288.46],["have",288.46,288.62],["you",288.62,288.72],["decided?",288.72,289.14]]},{"start":289.14,"end":292.14,"text":"Well, like my design for a book cover.","words":[["Well,",289.14,289.82],["like",290.36,290.78],["my",290.78,291.04],["design",291.04,291.44],["for",291.44,291.64],["a",291.64,291.76],["book",291.76,291.86],["cover.",291.86,292.14]]},{"start":292.68,"end":298.6,"text":"I just had a very simple design based on the book's title in this unusual handwritten script.","words":[["I",292.68,293.04],["just",293.04,293.22],["had",293.22,293.4],["a",293.4,293.5],["very",293.5,293.74],["simple",293.74,294.22],["design",294.22,294.76],["based",294.76,295.04],["on",295.04,295.3],["the",295.3,295.4],["book's",295.4,295.74],["title",295.74,296.14],["in",296.14,296.76],["this",296.76,297.04],["unusual",297.04,297.68],["handwritten",297.68,298.26],["script.",298.26,298.6]]},{"start":299.22,"end":305.22,"text":"So my reason for including that is it's a piece which shows the presentation of writing in design.","words":[["So",299.22,299.54],["my",299.54,300.14],["reason",300.14,300.6],["for",300.6,300.78],["including",300.78,301.14],["that",301.14,301.56],["is",301.56,302.16],["it's",302.16,302.6],["a",302.6,302.66],["piece",302.66,302.82],["which",302.82,303.14],["shows",303.14,303.44],["the",303.44,303.62],["presentation",303.62,304.14],["of",304.14,304.42],["writing",304.42,304.72],["in",304.72,304.96],["design.",304.96,305.22]]},{"start":305.7,"end":306.04,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",305.7,306.04]]},{"start":306.48,"end":311.48,"text":"Then I did some work on designing jewellery and I'm including that in my portfolio too.","words":[["Then",306.48,306.72],["I",306.72,306.88],["did",306.88,307.0],["some",307.0,307.18],["work",307.18,307.4],["on",307.4,307.6],["designing",307.6,308.02],["jewellery",308.02,308.64],["and",308.64,309.46],["I'm",309.46,309.9],["including",309.9,310.14],["that",310.14,310.44],["in",310.44,310.6],["my",310.6,310.72],["portfolio",310.72,311.04],["too.",311.04,311.48]]},{"start":312.02,"end":317.26,"text":"So is that to show how well you can express yourself using different media like metal?","words":[["So",312.02,312.32],["is",312.32,312.54],["that",312.54,312.7],["to",312.7,312.9],["show",312.9,313.12],["how",313.12,313.44],["well",313.44,313.7],["you",313.7,313.9],["can",313.9,314.06],["express",314.06,314.44],["yourself",314.44,314.96],["using",314.96,315.44],["different",315.44,315.9],["media",315.9,316.4],["like",316.4,316.84],["metal?",316.84,317.26]]},{"start":318.26,"end":322.78,"text":"That's not why I'm including it, no. What I actually learned from doing the","words":[["That's",318.26,318.78],["not",318.78,318.96],["why",318.96,319.28],["I'm",319.28,319.42],["including",319.42,319.8],["it,",319.8,320.06],["no.",320.08,320.28],["What",320.82,321.1],["I",321.1,321.26],["actually",321.26,321.66],["learned",321.66,322.0],["from",322.0,322.26],["doing",322.26,322.58],["the",322.58,322.78]]},{"start":322.78,"end":327.8,"text":"jewellery was the importance of precision, getting each little thing just right.","words":[["jewellery",322.78,323.3],["was",323.3,323.62],["the",323.62,323.78],["importance",323.78,324.24],["of",324.24,324.52],["precision,",324.52,325.06],["getting",325.6,325.86],["each",325.86,326.3],["little",326.3,326.7],["thing",326.7,327.06],["just",327.06,327.48],["right.",327.48,327.8]]},{"start":328.4,"end":330.88,"text":"So that's the reason I'm giving for including it.","words":[["So",328.4,328.68],["that's",328.68,329.26],["the",329.26,329.36],["reason",329.36,329.56],["I'm",329.56,329.78],["giving",329.78,330.0],["for",330.0,330.24],["including",330.24,330.58],["it.",330.58,330.88]]},{"start":331.22,"end":336.74,"text":"Oh I see. And are you going to include that wood carving you did, the one of a","words":[["Oh",331.22,331.52],["I",331.52,331.68],["see.",331.68,332.04],["And",332.88,333.22],["are",333.22,333.48],["you",333.48,333.62],["going",333.62,333.78],["to",333.78,333.98],["include",333.98,334.24],["that",334.24,334.5],["wood",334.5,334.78],["carving",334.78,335.16],["you",335.16,335.48],["did,",335.48,335.72],["the",336.2,336.34],["one",336.34,336.5],["of",336.5,336.64],["a",336.64,336.74]]},{"start":336.74,"end":340.08,"text":"fish you made from a piece of wood your sister picked up by the sea?","words":[["fish",336.74,336.98],["you",336.98,337.26],["made",337.26,337.48],["from",337.48,337.68],["a",337.68,337.84],["piece",337.84,337.98],["of",337.98,338.18],["wood",338.18,338.34],["your",338.34,338.56],["sister",338.56,338.9],["picked",338.9,339.28],["up",339.28,339.48],["by",339.48,339.66],["the",339.66,339.8],["sea?",339.8,340.08]]},{"start":340.32,"end":344.7,"text":"Yes, at first I was going to include that because I like the smooth scales of","words":[["Yes,",340.32,340.66],["at",341.16,341.38],["first",341.38,341.74],["I",341.74,342.02],["was",342.02,342.1],["going",342.1,342.28],["to",342.28,342.42],["include",342.42,342.68],["that",342.68,342.92],["because",342.92,343.16],["I",343.16,343.34],["like",343.34,343.5],["the",343.5,343.64],["smooth",343.64,343.96],["scales",343.96,344.4],["of",344.4,344.7]]},{"start":344.7,"end":349.14,"text":"the fish. But in the end, I decided it's an example of something that was completely","words":[["the",344.7,344.82],["fish.",344.82,345.1],["But",345.56,345.72],["in",345.72,345.86],["the",345.86,345.96],["end,",345.96,346.32],["I",346.48,346.66],["decided",346.66,347.06],["it's",347.06,347.34],["an",347.34,347.42],["example",347.42,347.78],["of",347.78,348.0],["something",348.0,348.28],["that",348.28,348.5],["was",348.5,348.62],["completely",348.62,349.14]]},{"start":349.14,"end":349.96,"text":"my own idea.","words":[["my",349.14,349.48],["own",349.48,349.64],["idea.",349.64,349.96]]},{"start":350.54,"end":351.4,"text":"Okay, good.","words":[["Okay,",350.54,350.96],["good.",351.16,351.4]]},{"start":351.88,"end":358.26,"text":"Then there was the advertisement. I did an ad for a hotel, a warm, cosy scene, with an","words":[["Then",351.88,352.3],["there",352.3,352.64],["was",352.64,352.84],["the",352.84,352.98],["advertisement.",352.98,353.46],["I",353.96,354.16],["did",354.16,354.36],["an",354.36,354.52],["ad",354.52,354.72],["for",354.72,354.94],["a",354.94,355.06],["hotel,",355.06,355.4],["a",355.96,356.08],["warm,",356.08,356.56],["cosy",356.84,357.28],["scene,",357.28,357.68],["with",357.92,358.12],["an",358.12,358.26]]},{"start":358.26,"end":359.7,"text":"illustration of an open fire.","words":[["illustration",358.26,358.62],["of",358.62,359.02],["an",359.02,359.12],["open",359.12,359.28],["fire.",359.28,359.7]]},{"start":359.98,"end":364.96,"text":"I remember. We had to show we could convey a feeling that matched the image of the","words":[["I",359.98,360.26],["remember.",360.26,360.64],["We",361.46,361.68],["had",361.68,361.86],["to",361.86,362.0],["show",362.0,362.24],["we",362.24,362.44],["could",362.44,362.62],["convey",362.62,362.94],["a",362.94,363.12],["feeling",363.12,363.5],["that",363.5,363.76],["matched",363.76,364.04],["the",364.04,364.36],["image",364.36,364.68],["of",364.68,364.84],["the",364.84,364.96]]},{"start":364.96,"end":369.96,"text":"product, didn't we? I did one for a fruit juice drink, trying to give an impression","words":[["product,",364.96,365.36],["didn't",365.6,365.8],["we?",365.8,365.96],["I",366.6,366.8],["did",366.8,366.96],["one",366.96,367.2],["for",367.2,367.42],["a",367.42,367.6],["fruit",367.6,367.74],["juice",367.74,368.04],["drink,",368.04,368.56],["trying",368.84,369.16],["to",369.16,369.34],["give",369.34,369.48],["an",369.48,369.58],["impression",369.58,369.96]]},{"start":369.96,"end":371.82,"text":"of vitality and energy.","words":[["of",369.96,370.22],["vitality",370.22,371.06],["and",371.06,371.38],["energy.",371.38,371.82]]},{"start":372.24,"end":373.7,"text":"Right. Well, now.","words":[["Right.",372.24,372.52],["Well,",372.98,373.22],["now.",373.5,373.7]]},{"start":373.7,"end":375.24,"text":"Now, shall we get on with that, Julie?","words":[["Now,",373.7,373.78],["shall",373.94,374.24],["we",374.24,374.4],["get",374.4,374.52],["on",374.52,374.68],["with",374.68,374.88],["that,",374.88,375.06],["Julie?",375.1,375.24]]},{"start":378.68,"end":380.6,"text":"That is the end of Part 3.","words":[["That",378.68,379.08],["is",379.08,379.22],["the",379.22,379.4],["end",379.4,379.84],["of",379.84,380.02],["Part",380.02,380.24],["3.",380.24,380.6]]},{"start":381.5,"end":385.56,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["You",381.5,381.72],["now",381.72,382.04],["have",382.04,382.42],["30",382.42,382.88],["seconds",382.88,383.36],["to",383.36,383.68],["check",383.68,383.98],["your",383.98,384.2],["answers",384.2,384.62],["to",384.62,384.94],["Part",384.94,385.16],["3.",385.16,385.56]]}]}